MASTER ONE-BLOCK PACK — JAPANESE ART GRAMMAR FOR STUDIO

PURPOSE
Turn the full Japanese Art Grammar system into one unified studio-ready pack:
reference intelligence → preset family → mode variants → prompt compiler → API shape → seed direction.

==================================================
1) MASTER REFERENCE STYLE
==================================================

reference_style:
  id: ref_japanese_art_grammar_master
  slug: japanese-art-grammar-master
  title: Japanese Art Grammar Master
  culture: Japanese
  period: Edo to Modern
  movement: Ukiyo-e → Folklore → Manga / Anime
  summary: Continuous Japanese visual grammar evolving from folklore storytelling and Edo woodblock prints into manga, anime, and game character design.
  source_type: curated_internal_reference
  notes: Preserve Edo visual grammar while adapting for modern character and concept design.

==================================================
2) MASTER VISUAL GRAMMAR
==================================================

grammar:

  composition:
    layout: vertical narrative poster
    hero_focus: dominant central figure
    support_elements:
      - animals
      - spirits
      - symbolic objects
    depth: flattened perspective
    scene_logic: symbolic tableau storytelling

  linework:
    line_type: carved ink outline
    line_weight: medium-heavy
    variation: slight irregularity
    shadow: minimal
    style: graphic woodblock illustration

  color_system:
    pigment_type: flat mineral pigments
    core_palette:
      - indigo blue
      - vermilion red
      - ochre yellow
      - moss green
      - parchment beige
    contrast: strong color blocks
    gradient: none

  material:
    paper: washi paper
    fiber_visibility: subtle
    pigment_bleed: slight
    texture: organic paper grain

  motif:
    animals:
      - toad
      - snake
      - slug
      - fox
      - yokai spirits
    nature_symbols:
      - cloud swirl
      - wave pattern
      - mountain silhouette
      - bamboo
    story_logic: symbolic creatures represent natural or spiritual forces and interact with the hero through visual storytelling

  character:
    face:
      skin: ivory pale
      eyes: narrow almond
      nose: straight minimal
      mouth: small subtle
      emotion: restrained
    pose:
      pose_type: kabuki theatrical stance
      gesture: expressive hand movement
      body_angle: dramatic twist

  fashion:
    bijin_ga_body:
      body: elongated elegance
      neck: long
      shoulders: narrow
      movement: restrained grace
    hair:
      style: shimada bun
      structure: sculptural volume
      accessory: hairpins and combs
      outline: strong black contour
    kimono_textile:
      patterns:
        - vertical stripes
        - floral repeat
        - geometric motifs
      density: medium
      colors: muted pigments

  decorative:
    cartouche:
      shape: vertical red capsule
      content: kanji brush lettering
    cloud_swirl:
      shape: rounded spiral cloud
      function: decorative framing element
    pattern_layers:
      - textile motifs
      - wave geometry
      - repeating ornament

  adaptation:
    modern_bridge:
      line: cleaner ink drawing or digital ink
      color: brighter or more saturated palette
      composition: narrative panels or dynamic action framing
      emotion: more expressive faces

==================================================
3) PRESET FAMILY
==================================================

presets:

  - slug: edo_folklore_print
    title: Edo Folklore Print
    preset_type: style_foundation
    intent: folklore tableau illustration
    subject_rule: central heroic or spiritual figure interacting with symbolic folklore creatures
    composition_rule: vertical narrative poster, flattened perspective, dominant central figure, symbolic supporting elements
    linework_rule: carved ink outline, medium-heavy weight, slight irregularity, minimal shadow
    color_rule: flat mineral pigments using indigo, vermilion, ochre, moss green, parchment beige
    material_rule: visible washi texture, subtle fiber grain, slight pigment bleed
    motif_rule: include at least one folklore animal and one natural symbolic motif
    wardrobe_rule: traditional Japanese robe or period costume
    mood_rule: restrained, symbolic, mythic, ceremonial
    decorative_rule: cloud swirl framing, optional red cartouche, patterned textiles
    positive_prompt_template: Edo ukiyo-e inspired illustration, central heroic figure, symbolic folklore animals, decorative cloud swirl motifs, traditional Japanese costume, flat mineral pigment colors, carved woodblock ink outlines, visible washi paper texture, vertical narrative poster composition
    negative_prompt_template: photorealism, cinematic depth blur, glossy 3D rendering, western costume, neon cyberpunk lighting, excessive gradients, soft airbrush shading, modern typography
    default_params:
      aspect_ratio: 2:3
      stylization: high
      detail_level: medium
      palette_lock: true
      texture_emphasis: medium

  - slug: kabuki_actor_portrait
    title: Kabuki Actor Portrait
    preset_type: character_portrait
    intent: dramatic theatrical portrait
    subject_rule: single dominant character in theatrical kabuki pose
    composition_rule: portrait-led vertical frame, dramatic twist, dominant face and hands
    linework_rule: bold ink contour with minimal shadow
    color_rule: flat pigments with strong red, indigo, parchment and black accents
    material_rule: paper print feel and textile pattern emphasis
    motif_rule: minimal symbolic props only
    wardrobe_rule: kabuki costume styling and graphic patterning
    mood_rule: dramatic, ceremonial, iconic
    decorative_rule: optional cartouche and patterned border
    positive_prompt_template: kabuki actor portrait, dramatic theatrical stance, bold carved ink contours, flat Edo pigment palette, strong pattern costume, iconic Japanese print composition, visible washi paper grain
    negative_prompt_template: realistic photography, soft western fashion portrait, cinematic bokeh, metallic sci-fi armor, glossy skin, painterly oil brushwork
    default_params:
      aspect_ratio: 3:4
      stylization: high
      portrait_focus: face_hands
      texture_emphasis: medium

  - slug: bijin_ga_elegant_women
    title: Bijin-ga Elegant Women
    preset_type: female_beauty
    intent: refined feminine elegance
    subject_rule: elongated elegant female figure with restrained grace
    composition_rule: vertical portrait or half-body composition with balanced posture
    linework_rule: strong black contour, clean facial simplification, minimal shadow
    color_rule: muted pigment palette with elegant textile accents
    material_rule: silk and paper feel, subtle pattern rhythm
    motif_rule: light decorative elements and floral geometry
    wardrobe_rule: kimono with floral or geometric textile patterns, shimada bun with hairpins
    mood_rule: refined, distant, graceful, poised
    decorative_rule: ornamental pattern fields and optional calligraphic framing
    positive_prompt_template: bijin-ga inspired elegant woman, elongated graceful proportions, shimada bun with hairpins, patterned kimono, strong black contour, muted Edo pigment palette, refined Japanese print composition, visible paper texture
    negative_prompt_template: modern streetwear, glossy fashion editorial photography, hyperreal skin rendering, western hairstyle, excessive facial emotion, neon gradients, plastic textures
    default_params:
      aspect_ratio: 3:4
      stylization: high
      detail_level: medium
      beauty_focus: hair_kimono_face

  - slug: yokai_creature_scene
    title: Yokai Creature Scene
    preset_type: creature_scene
    intent: mythic supernatural tableau
    subject_rule: supernatural yokai or symbolic creature as dominant subject or force in scene
    composition_rule: story tableau with flattened depth and strong silhouette staging
    linework_rule: bold carved outlines with graphic clarity
    color_rule: high-contrast flat pigment blocks with mythic atmosphere
    material_rule: paper, ink and organic texture emphasis
    motif_rule: cloud swirl, mountain, wave, spirit symbols
    wardrobe_rule: optional period garments if human character present
    mood_rule: uncanny, mythic, symbolic, ritualistic
    decorative_rule: graphic framing and folklore symbols
    positive_prompt_template: Edo folklore yokai scene, supernatural creature tableau, bold carved outlines, flat mineral pigments, symbolic cloud and wave motifs, Japanese print composition, visible washi texture
    negative_prompt_template: 3D monster rendering, cinematic horror realism, slime CGI, western fantasy armor, deep perspective realism, modern action poster typography
    default_params:
      aspect_ratio: 2:3
      stylization: high
      silhouette_emphasis: high
      mood_density: medium_high

  - slug: edo_manga_hybrid
    title: Edo Manga Hybrid
    preset_type: hybrid_modern
    intent: modern character design built on Edo grammar
    subject_rule: central anime-style or manga-style hero built on ukiyo-e composition and symbolism
    composition_rule: central hero framing with optional action energy while preserving graphic poster structure
    linework_rule: clean digital ink inheriting carved contour logic
    color_rule: saturated modern palette anchored by indigo, vermilion, ochre and parchment base
    material_rule: paper-print influence mixed with clean illustration finish
    motif_rule: animal spirit summons, cloud swirl graphics, symbolic props
    wardrobe_rule: hybrid traditional-modern Japanese costume language
    mood_rule: mythic, stylish, dynamic, iconic
    decorative_rule: graphic framing, symbolic motifs, manga-era readability
    positive_prompt_template: modern manga character design based on Edo ukiyo-e grammar, central hero composition, animal spirit motif, cloud swirl graphics, clean digital ink, saturated but controlled Japanese palette, symbolic costume design, iconic poster-like framing
    negative_prompt_template: generic shonen screenshot, random sci-fi clutter, western superhero anatomy, 3D game render, photographic lighting, uncontrolled neon palette, empty background
    default_params:
      aspect_ratio: 3:4
      stylization: medium_high
      readability: high
      hybrid_balance: edo_60_modern_40

==================================================
4) SHARED MODE VARIANTS
==================================================

variants:

  - code: canon_core
    title: Canon Core
    mode: canon_core
    delta_composition_rule: preserve flattened perspective, vertical poster logic, restrained storytelling
    delta_color_rule: strictly limit palette to Edo mineral pigments and muted print behavior
    delta_mood_rule: restrained, ceremonial, timeless
    delta_prompt_append: preserve historical print grammar, avoid excessive modern stylization
    delta_negative_append: anime facial exaggeration, glossy rendering, cinematic realism, modern fashion drift
    params_override:
      stylization: high
      palette_lock: true
      historical_fidelity: high

  - code: luminous_fan_appeal
    title: Luminous Fan Appeal
    mode: luminous_fan_appeal
    delta_composition_rule: increase clarity of hero silhouette and visual attraction while keeping poster logic
    delta_color_rule: slightly brighter pigments with stronger focal contrast
    delta_mood_rule: alluring, elegant, emotionally magnetic
    delta_prompt_append: enhance hero appeal, improve silhouette attraction, preserve Edo symbolic structure
    delta_negative_append: cheap idol gloss, overexposed highlights, plastic skin, random modern glam
    params_override:
      stylization: medium_high
      fan_appeal_boost: medium
      contrast_focus: hero

  - code: luxury_mystical_editorial
    title: Luxury Mystical Editorial
    mode: luxury_mystical_editorial
    delta_composition_rule: retain symbolic framing but add premium editorial elegance and stronger visual hierarchy
    delta_color_rule: controlled luxury palette using deep indigo, aged gold, parchment and lacquer accents
    delta_mood_rule: mystical, refined, elite, iconic
    delta_prompt_append: premium visual hierarchy, refined ornamental elegance, mythic luxury atmosphere
    delta_negative_append: cheap fantasy clutter, oversaturated anime colors, gaudy gold overload, noisy background
    params_override:
      stylization: high
      luxury_tone: high
      ornament_density: medium

==================================================
5) OBJECTIVE OVERRIDE MAP
==================================================

objective_overrides:
  poster: iconic poster readability, strong focal hierarchy, clean hero silhouette
  character_sheet: clear costume readability, front-facing design clarity, silhouette integrity
  lore_scene: denser symbolic motifs, mythic environment storytelling, narrative object placement
  social_asset: high visual clarity, compact symbolic framing, eye-catching central design
  key_visual: premium composition balance, striking hero presentation, refined decorative rhythm

==================================================
6) PROMPT COMPILER LOGIC
==================================================

compile_order:
  - subject_rule
  - composition_rule
  - linework_rule
  - color_rule
  - material_rule
  - motif_rule
  - wardrobe_rule
  - mood_rule
  - decorative_rule
  - variant.delta_prompt_append
  - objective_override
  - subject_override_if_any

positive_prompt_skeleton:
  [subject_rule], [composition_rule], [linework_rule], [color_rule], [material_rule], [motif_rule], [wardrobe_rule], [mood_rule], [decorative_rule], [variant.delta_prompt_append], [objective_override], [subject_override_if_any]

negative_prompt_skeleton:
  [preset.negative_prompt_template], [variant.delta_negative_append], [objective_specific_negatives_if_any]

compiler_rules:
  - if preset == bijin_ga_elegant_women, auto preserve hair + kimono elegance
  - if preset == edo_manga_hybrid, allow clean digital ink and modern readability
  - if objective == poster, force strong focal hierarchy
  - if objective == lore_scene, increase motif density
  - if variant == canon_core, reduce modern drift
  - if variant == luminous_fan_appeal, boost silhouette attraction without breaking Edo base
  - if variant == luxury_mystical_editorial, increase ornamental refinement and premium mood

